"`.github/workflows/macos.yml` 一致。"

#: ../../08-build.md:58 d9e8e156ae464f13ad1e35bc9a2d7dbe
msgid "Toolchain"
msgstr "工具链"

#: ../../08-build.md:65 555760e6219c4386a2c189af505b7c7b
msgid ""
"GNU autotools floors are in `scripts/ci/build-requirements.sh` (autoconf `>="
" 2.59`, automake `>= 1.7`, libtool `>= 1.5.14`). On macOS use Homebrew "
"`libtool` (`glibtool`); Apple’s stock tools are too old."
msgstr ""
"GNU autotools 最低版本位于 `scripts/ci/build-requirements.sh`（autoconf `>= "
"2.59`、automake `>= 1.7`、libtool `>= 1.5.14`）。在 macOS 上使用 Homebrew 的 "
"`libtool`（`glibtool`）；Apple 自带工具版本太旧。"

#: ../../08-build.md:67 090168a08cdd410e85971599b4f40c71
msgid "Homebrew packages"
msgstr "Homebrew 软件包"

#: ../../08-build.md:102 59cd20ebeb2d47e5b3e1e3549e30e9fb
msgid ""
"CI also runs `brew install --adopt` for the SignalWire formulas (overwrite a"
" conflicting cellar install). The runner-only `brew uninstall cmake` step is"
" **not** needed on a developer Mac."
msgstr ""
"CI 还会对 SignalWire formulas 运行 `brew install --adopt`（覆盖冲突的 cellar 安装）。仅针对 "
"runner 的 `brew uninstall cmake` 步骤在开发者 Mac 上**不需要**。"

#: ../../08-build.md:104 2999310d53b6412ca1cfe2b0e979c63c
msgid ""
"On Apple Silicon, Homebrew lives under `/opt/homebrew`. `ffmpeg@7` and "
"`libpq@18` are keg-only; CI force-links them so `pkg-config` / `configure` "
"see them. If you skip the force-link, add those prefixes to "
"`PKG_CONFIG_PATH` (and often `PATH` / `LDFLAGS`) before `./configure`."
msgstr ""
"在 Apple Silicon 上，Homebrew 位于 `/opt/homebrew`。`ffmpeg@7` 和 `libpq@18` 是 keg-"
"only 软件包；CI 会强制链接它们，使 `pkg-config` / `configure` 能够找到。如果跳过强制链接，请在 "
"`./configure` 前将这些前缀加入 `PKG_CONFIG_PATH`（通常还要加入 `PATH` / `LDFLAGS`）。"

#: ../../08-build.md:106 8780c751b29449d1a3dc41c86cbf2fe4
msgid "Configure, build, install"
msgstr "配置、构建、安装"

#: ../../08-build.md:108 12a9cb81737647a8a958c0734091ef11
msgid ""
"Use a home prefix so you do not need root. The command below uses "
"`--disable-fhs` so the installed `bin/`, `conf/`, `mod/`, `db/`, `log/`, and"
" `run/` directories stay below `$HOME/fs`. Default without `--prefix` is "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`). macOS CI uses `--prefix=…/OUT` "
"plus `--enable-shared --enable-static` and therefore follows its FHS-style "
"output paths."
msgstr ""
"使用家目录前缀即可无需 root。下面的命令使用 `--disable-fhs`，因此安装后的 "
"`bin/`、`conf/`、`mod/`、`db/`、`log/` 和 `run/` 目录都位于 `$HOME/fs` 下。不带 `--prefix`"
" 时默认前缀为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。macOS CI 使用 `--prefix=…/OUT`"
" 加上 `--enable-shared --enable-static`，因此遵循 FHS 风格的输出路径。"

#: ../../08-build.md:123 50c6e8cf19bc43f8b9c2badbc244d99b
msgid ""
"`bootstrap.sh` copies `build/modules.conf.in` → `modules.conf` if missing, "
"then runs Autotools. `-j` parallelizes bundled library bootstraps."
msgstr ""
"如果 `modules.conf` 不存在，`bootstrap.sh` 会复制 `build/modules.conf.in` → "
"`modules.conf`，然后运行 Autotools。`-j` 会并行执行捆绑库的 bootstrap。"

#: ../../08-build.md:124 f98a8b80232d490d8d57a9bdfd2a66b5
msgid ""
"Edit **`modules.conf`** (build list: `src/mod/...` lines) **after** "
"bootstrap and **before** `./configure` / `make`. Runtime load is a separate "
"file: `modules.conf.xml`. A compiled module can still be unloaded."
msgstr ""
"请在 bootstrap **之后**、`./configure` / `make` **之前**编辑 "
"**`modules.conf`**（构建列表：`src/mod/...` "
"行）。运行时加载使用另一个文件：`modules.conf.xml`。已编译的模块仍可能处于未加载状态。"

#: ../../08-build.md:125 de630f658aac436293a54221ac1202e6
msgid ""
"`make install` installs vanilla sample config when `$prefix/conf` does not "
"exist (`samples-conf`)."
msgstr ""
"当 `$prefix/conf` 不存在时，`make install` 会安装 vanilla 示例配置（`samples-conf`）。"

#: ../../08-build.md:126 7f4979d820a6415e8a93f36a85846cc7
msgid ""
"Sounds / music-on-hold are **not** in git. If you need playback or the echo "
"test: `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-install` (see [Quick Start](01-quick-"
"start.md))."
msgstr ""
"声音和保持音乐**不在** git 中。如果需要播放或回声测试，请运行 `make cd-sounds-install cd-moh-"
"install`（参见[快速开始](01-quick-start.md)）。"

#: ../../08-build.md:127 9a3ef522190d47789faa3be945e037be
msgid ""
"Debug CFLAGS (`-ggdb3 -O0`): `./devel-bootstrap.sh` instead of "
"`./bootstrap.sh`."
msgstr ""
"调试 CFLAGS（`-ggdb3 -O0`）：使用 `./devel-bootstrap.sh`，不要使用 `./bootstrap.sh`。"

#: ../../08-build.md:129 245506ade24c48a3a93ab76354cc36dc
msgid "Run (prefix install)"
msgstr "运行（前缀安装）"

#: ../../08-build.md:136 5ffb3aa17e66496fa9196d25617b1ba2
msgid ""
"A working process prints a line starting with `UP`. Stop with "
"`\"$HOME/fs/bin/freeswitch\" -stop`. Vanilla is a **demo PBX**, not "
"production: SIP users `1000`–`1019` share password `1234`; the `fs_cli` "
"client targets `127.0.0.1:8021` by default, while vanilla ESL listens on "
"wildcard `::`:8021 with password `ClueCon`. Start with `-nonat` unless you "
"want UPnP NAT helpers. First-call steps: [Quick Start](01-quick-start.md)."
msgstr ""
"正常运行的进程会输出以 `UP` 开头的一行。使用 `\"$HOME/fs/bin/freeswitch\" -stop` 停止。Vanilla "
"是**演示 PBX**，不是生产配置：SIP 用户 `1000`–`1019` 共用密码 `1234`；`fs_cli` 客户端默认连接 "
"`127.0.0.1:8021`，而 vanilla ESL 在通配 `::`:8021 上监听，密码为 `ClueCon`。除非需要 UPnP NAT"
" 辅助，否则请使用 `-nonat` 启动。首次呼叫步骤见[快速开始](01-quick-start.md)。"

#: ../../08-build.md:138 245506ade24c48a3a93ab76354cc36dc
msgid "Production / prefix install"
msgstr "生产 / 前缀安装"

#: ../../08-build.md:140 d93dad3defba4369a4a1de316bce3914
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Same `configure && make && make install`. Default prefix is "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch` (`AC_PREFIX_DEFAULT` in `configure.ac`). With an "
"explicit custom prefix, `configure` enables FHS layout unless `--disable-"
"fhs` is supplied; modules then go under `${libdir}/freeswitch/mod` and "
"configuration under `${sysconfdir}/freeswitch`. Use [Quick Start](01-quick-"
"start.md#source-build-developer-path) for the single-prefix developer "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"同样是 `configure && make && make install`。默认前缀为 "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac` 中的 "
"`AC_PREFIX_DEFAULT`）。显式指定自定义前缀时，除非提供 `--disable-fhs`，否则 `configure` 会启用 FHS "
"布局；模块位于 `${libdir}/freeswitch/mod`，配置位于 "
"`${sysconfdir}/freeswitch`。单前缀开发者布局请参见[快速开始](01-quick-start.md#source-build-"
"developer-path)。"

#: ../../08-build.md:142 94d7e133c3c6413d941c42c17160a157
